    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "receiving an order",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼は上司からの重要な任務の受命に、身が引き締まる思いだった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "承知いたしました。この命令を謹んで受命いたします。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その依頼は、まだ正式な受命には至っていない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "洛誥篇の最後に「惟周公誕保文武受命惟七年」と書いてありますが、その前に「在十有二月」と書いてあります。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "支那歴史的思想の起源",
                "author": "内藤湖南",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "受命于天　既寿永昌　孔明はひと目見るやたいへん驚いて、「これこそ、ほんとうの伝国の玉璽である。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "三国志",
                "author": "出師の巻",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "receiving a mandate from heaven and becoming an emperor (in China)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "この国難を乗り越えるため、新たな指導者が神聖な受命を受けた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "中国史において、皇帝の権威は「天命受命」の思想に基づいていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "古代中国の皇帝は受命によって統治権を得たと信じられていた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
    ],
    "relations": {
